Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you naughty naughty man!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you, whatever you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's imperative that you refrain\Nfrom touching any electrical outlets!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I already did, Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if what I know about magnets is\Ntrue, we're being forced together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I really hate saying this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, we've gotten\Nourselves into a world of trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.53,0:01:00.37,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the last page of the last page,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hora!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.66,0:02:29.96,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(692,646)\pos(151,850)}Episode 31: Bast's Mariah, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec! Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.41,0:02:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's getting away after her!
