Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You getting hysterical\Nisn't helping anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus on figuring out how to\Noverpower this blasted stand. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where did that woman run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care. Anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't keep rolling\Nin the dirt forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we try slowly standing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we're upright, the next step\Nis to try pulling away from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's going to be\Neasier said than done,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since the magnetic force that's currently\Nholding us together has been doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now, let's use that fence to\Ntry getting out of this predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do it, Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get those stomach muscles ready\Nand make sure you stay in sync!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready when you are, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, this is one of the most\Nembarrassing things I've ever done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that we're just\Npracticing our dance moves? True!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a perfect day for dancing outdoors!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now run along!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.98,0:04:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost got it, Avdul!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it and we're still standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, a remarkable feat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Abdaal, now that we've gotten over\Nhere, do you think you can slide off me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might be able to. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what we're going to\Ndo, so listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold onto the fence as tightly\Nas I can while you slide down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free yourself once you've\Ngotten to the tip of my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see how our faces are stuck together\Nas opposed to the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's more than likely a sign that my feet\Nand your head should repel each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.72,SC 31 Positive,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,0)\be0.4\pos(121.428,812.572)}Positive
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.72,SC 31 Positive,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,0)\be0.2\pos(1806.572,358.286)}Positive
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.72,SC 31 Negative,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,0)\be0.2\pos(1789.429,949.714)}Negative
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.72,SC 31 Negative,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(375,0)\be0.2\pos(148.858,198.856)}Negative
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that makes a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way, Abdal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, what's the\Nmatter with you, Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this\Nposition is a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pose is highly suggestive, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toastar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone were to see us, they\Nwould be inclined to think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come off it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's looking at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and slide off my...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those little brats came back\Nand brought their friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a hike?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to see, so knock\Nit off with a staring, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said beat it, you little ankle biters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry up and get off\Nme before this gets any worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying as hard as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The embarrassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll be the one to move! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, please slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
