Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.43,0:05:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, moving around like that\Nmakes it seem as though we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's that old hag again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I come back expecting\Nto find my handsome man,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and instead my eyes are\Nassaulted with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you tie with the\Nfragile gift of a maiden's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You filthy cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the love of God, hurry, Abdel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's getting closer and I can\Nalready feel the tears coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are, Father Skel-Draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, little dog, you've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to stay far apart from each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your magnetic pull is getting\Nmore powerful by the second!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It serves you great, you dead pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your boy toy go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:07:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at her having\Nher morning cigarette!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, try going after her from that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let her get\Naway from us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's cunning, so this may be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be! Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, it would appear as though we've\Nalready fallen right into her trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.00,0:07:23.04,SFXOang,3,0,0,0,,{=12}{\blur0.8\fade(255,0,255,0,0,1400,1750)\frz36.29\pos(480.01,79.99)\c&H090F18&}Doom
