Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.71,0:07:24.75,SFXOang,3,0,0,0,,{=12}{\bord0\blur0.8\fade(255,0,255,-1710,-1710,-310,40)\frz36.29\pos(487.85,165.45)\shad3\4a&HFF&}Doom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're going to\Nbe able to get off that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem that we're\Nstuck together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.19,0:07:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, something is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, we have to get the hell\Nout of here as fast as we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, I need you to use Magician's\NRed to burn through the tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I don't think that would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here! There's a train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and melt those tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried telling you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were to burn away these tracks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The train would derail, and innocent\Npeople would go tumbling to their deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn woman is pure,\Nunadulterated evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost positive my vines would be\Nable to hold her, but at that distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's too far out of range\Nfor them to even reach her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So our best bet is me\Ntrying to pull us free
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the tracks using\Nthat post as an anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The magnetic pull is even\Nstronger than it was before!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, it's life or death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop pulling no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to pull harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't work!
