Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took care of them for you, Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's done, I'm going to\Ndo away with Jotaro and Polnare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thinking, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only someone as clever\Nas you would burn the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,railroad tracks and dig\Na trench underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, unlike that earlier incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Muhammad Avdol does indeed\Nhave a decent modicum of class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing things this way is\Na little more my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think you've outsmarted me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obnoxious pieces of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elections! Run!
