Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to keep a grip on\Nyour neck until you pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can count on being in the\Nhospital for at least a week or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just let you and your\Nmagnetic power run free, can I?
