Dialogue: 2,0:11:22.66,0:11:22.70,SFXPurp2,8,0,0,0,,{=37}{\blur0.6\bord0\fscx132.28\fscy101.75\frz8.671\pos(-33.18,608.55)\4a&HFF&}Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, your imagination's running wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint, boys, but\Nmy breasts aren't getting larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no need to worry yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because your magnetism's\Ngrowing even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lucky for me, I just happened\Nto stuff my bra with weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, we have incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your magnetism will keep intensifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least until your bodies\Nare crushed to tiny pieces. Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's getting away again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all part of her strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's moving farther away from us in\Norder to maintain a safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, that woman's a stand user, so\Nshe needs to stay close to her target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she gets too close to us,\Nwe'll be able to catch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if she's too far out of\Nrange, her power won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This magnetism is still just a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The normal rules apply,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means if she puts too much distance\Nbetween us, the magnetism should weaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't get free, the magnetic\Nforce will just continue to intensify.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we keep running\Nuntil we're out of range?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might be our best bet. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might be able to get away from our\Npowers for a short amount of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the stand would still prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've run away from fights before,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've only done so when retreat\Nwas part of the overall strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how hopeless things look,\NJoseph Joestar never throws in the towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real showdown begins now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've drawn a map of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's our current position.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's where the woman's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as she continues\Nmoving down this road,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll eventually loop around\Nand head back this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll split up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here is where\Nwe'll catch that witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.10,0:13:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if she's a woman or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we catch her, she's\Ngetting a taste of my bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out! Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's cut the rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The locals are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure one of them will have\Nthe foresight to notify the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,authorities about the tracks\Nbefore the next train arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is definitely up. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear someone cut the rail line?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about all the trains?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:13:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, they've stopped running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone actually cut the rail line?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People nowadays sure are\Nsick, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind would do\Nsomething so terrible, Major Douche Canoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.06,0:14:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jotaro, you want to know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rotten people always get\Nwhat's coming to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mark my words, they'll get theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saved three months' salary all for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the? Wait!\NWait at the... The ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those morons are getting closer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at this rate, they'll never catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, you're looking\Na little weighted down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, the wild\Ngoose chase ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interestingly enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would seem that the two of us are more\Nfamiliar with this town than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.22,0:16:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take a look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're now caught between us, and\Nthere's nowhere for you to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may have taken a while to get\Nhere, but the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think I have nowhere to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys truly haven't\Nrealized it yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only thought you were hunting me when
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really I was luring you\Nhere the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up, idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High voltage power lines! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power lines are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power lines are extremely magnetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're going\Nto fry this time, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol might be able to defend\Nhimself for now with his flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die, Joestar. My stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the goddess Bast, is the perfect trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's also far more powerful\Nthan your hermit purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you've said your prayers,\Nbecause it's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vile woman, my flames will\Nburn you and your evil alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My entire body is being pulled\Nin another direction! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't resist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My flame should be strong enough to\Nmelt the steel without a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't defend\Nmyself from every attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weight is crushing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since you're going to die anyway, I can\Nconfess that I find you to be quite a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that I only\Nknew you for a short time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you were so clever and hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention your experience would\Nmake younger men green with envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, you're very handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you and I are decades apart,\Nbut if I'm being honest with myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would have made a splendid lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's how you\Ntruly feel about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then what do you say you give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen the light and\Nrealized that your stand is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way more powerful than\Nmine could ever hope to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to turn off the magnetism!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no, I don't think I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you are exceptionally handsome,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're nowhere near as\Ngood-looking as Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're saying that you refuse to\Nturn off the power no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, don't you have some dying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm grambling to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't say it again, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how you're going to be,\Nthen it's your loss, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! Shit!
