Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to us earlier or\Nyou've been caught between us the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnets are attracted\Nto each other, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to do anything about it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but getting between us\Nwas your biggest blunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way she can hear you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's already lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the metal and magnetic\Nforces crushed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's very likely that she's broken\Nmore than a few bones in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, why don't we get that\Nbreakfast we were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, a wonderful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this running around\Nhas made me rather hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really only 9 a .m.? Damn... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pieces of shit!
