Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are taking forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as they've been in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd think they were putting on\Nmakeup and dressing for a gala.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's almost 9 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may have run into\Nan enemy on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we should see where\Nthey ran off to? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me.
